n for his park and platoon profile, the high-skill environment creates a non-zero risk of a sub-optimal outcome. We are leaning heavily on **Jos\u00e9 Ram\u00edrez** and **Daulton Varsho** to stabilize the offensive production while monitoring the lineups for any late scratches that could necessitate a tactical defensive substitution.",
